[7] Being aggrieved and dissatisfied with the award passed by the learned L.A Judge, the appellant has filed this instant appeal seeking the following relief :
"(i) Admit the appeal;
(ii) Call for the records pertaining to Case No. Misc.(LA) 22 of 2016 from the Ld.
Land Acquisition Judge, Court No.3, West Tripura, Agartala;
(iii) Pass an order for preparation of paper book;
(iv) In the interim be kind enough to stay the impugned judgment dated 14.05.2019,
Case No. MISC (LA) 22 of 2016 till disposal of the appeal;
(v) After hearing the parties, be kind enough to set aside the judgment dated 14.05.2019 passed in Case No. MISC (LA) 22 of 2016 for the fair ends of justice."
